<title>USA: Diana completes Atlanta sale, books charge.</title>
<headline>Diana completes Atlanta sale, books charge.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diana Corp said on Tuesday that it has completed the sale of its Atlanta Provision Co assets to  Colorado Boxed Beef Co and expects to report charges of about $2 million as a result of the sale.</p>
<p>Diana said it sold the assets of its meat and seafood business for about $14 milllion, less the assumption of liabilities.</p>
